# Routing example.
#
# One message goes in, and the chain of providers it would be sent through comes
# out, with the reason for every provider that was left out. No Go, no sending: the
# whole decision is the rules in ../rules, and this directory only gathers the facts
# they read. Run it with
#
#   make run dir=./examples/rules
#
# and see README.md for what to ask it.

name "routing-example"
environment env("APP_ENV", "development")
